        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana BBN2012, Wall Mounted Soap Holder With Glass</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe modern appeal of the BBN Series Soap Holder can be found both in the contemporary wall mount with concealed screws and in the 2 chic finishes in which it is available. The bracket and rose are available in satin nickel or polished chrome finishes and the dish is made of glass. It is made with the attention to quality Deltana is known for; and when mounted to the wall, this soap dish will make an ultra fashionable--yet functional--accessory to any bathroom.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-BBN2012-specifications.gif?v=1704354556\" width=\"600\" height=\"298\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana BBN2012 Soap Holder with Glass Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nShop more of the <a href=\"/search?type=product&q=Deltana BBN Nobe Series\"><b>Deltana BBN Series Bathroom Accessories</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the BBN Modern Soap Dish:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Zinc mount (available in satin nickel or polished chrome finishes) with a glass dish.</li>\r\n<li>Overall Projection: 4-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Wall Mount Diameter: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-BBN2012.pdf?v=1691095346\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana BBN2012 Soap Holder with Glass Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold Individually.</b> Package includes: 1 soap dish, mounting screw cover, and all necessary mounting screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>This is a Limited Series. <b>Limited Quantities Available</b></i>\r\n</p>",
