                "description": "Deltana BBN2012 Glass Wall Mounted Soap Dish - The modern appeal of the BBN Series Soap Holder can be found both in the contemporary wall mount with concealed screws and in the 2 chic finishes in which it is available. The bracket and rose are available in satin nickel or polished chrome finishes and the dish is made of glass. It is made with the attention to quality Deltana is known for; and when mounted to the wall, this soap dish will make an ultra fashionable--yet functional--accessory to any bathroom.",
